<title>CHINA: Road King declares first final results.</title>
<headline>Road King declares first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31.</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   45</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    226.12</p>
<p>    Turnover		     179.41</p>
<p>    Company name		 Road King Infrastructure Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 11-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Oct 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Road King a spinoff of civil engineering group Wai Kee Holdings Ltd. It was listed on the Stock Exchange on July 4, 1996. Net is after an operating profit of HK$148.64 million, and share of profit of associated companies of HK$77.78 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
